AUDIO: 'examples that will showcase the issues in prompting that can arise with micro detailing. So, here are a couple variations of this alien that I generated. And you\'ll notice in the background that I had prompted for micro'

[10:57] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'details and I got way too many. And this is due to the models\' overcompensation when using tags that include detail aspects. So, you really want to refrain from using those if at all, or keep them'

[11:11] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'to a bare minimum. Because it ruined almost every one of these images. So. You can also see here how micro skin details, if you prompt for that, it can just completely ruin the image. Like'

[11:23] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'even from far away, she just looks furry kind of. Same thing with this image. There\'s a lot of weird extra detail that doesn\'t need to be there. And all of these examples that you\'re'

